    <!-- Privacy Policy Screen -->
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_intro">Last updated: 11/2026\n\nWelcome to QuizMark. Protecting your personal information is our top priority. Please read the following policies carefully.</string>
    <string name="privacy_h1">1. Data Collection</string>
    <string name="privacy_b1">QuizMark only collects the data necessary to manage user accounts, student lists, and grading history. This data includes email addresses, names, and grade report files you create.</string>
    <string name="privacy_h2">2. Data Storage &amp; Synchronization</string>
    <string name="privacy_b2">Most data (including photos of exam papers) is processed directly on your device (Offline-first). Data is only synchronized with our cloud server (Firebase) when an internet connection is available, helping prevent data loss when you switch devices.</string>
    <string name="privacy_h3">3. Data Sharing</string>
    <string name="privacy_b3">We are committed to never selling, trading, or sharing personal information, class lists, or student scores with any third party for commercial purposes.</string>

